<component>
    <div v-flex="" class="case-pane doc-pane">
        <h2>{t("case.tab_bar.title")}</h2>
        <p>TabBar 是 RML 的标签栏组件，标签为 PascalCase <code>TabBar</code> 或 kebab-case <code>tab-bar</code>。子项用 <code>Tab</code> 标签，<code>label</code> 属性指定标题，<code>icon</code> 属性添加图标。核心概念：5 种 variant（<code>underline</code>/<code>pill</code>/<code>flat</code>/<code>outline</code>/<code>segmented</code>）通过同名属性切换；尺寸用 <code>size</code> 属性；<code>prefix</code>/<code>suffix</code> 注入首尾元素；<code>menu</code> 模式启用下拉；<code>on-click</code> 事件回调选中索引（签名 <code>fn(index: usize)</code>）。模板定制（高级）：Tab 实现 ParentElement，element 子节点通过 <code>.child()</code> 注入作为标题内容，绕过 label/icon 限制。</p>

        <Card title="演示效果">
            <p>{status_text}</p>

            <div class="demo-section">
                <h3>{t("case.tab_bar.basic")}</h3>
                <TabBar selected-index={active_tab} on-click={on_tab_select}>
                    <Tab label="Account" />
                    <Tab label="Profile" />
                    <Tab label="Settings" />
                </TabBar>
            </div>

            <div class="demo-section">
                <h3>{t("case.tab_bar.variants")}</h3>
                <TabBar>
                    <Tab label="Underline" />
                    <Tab label="B" />
                </TabBar>
                <TabBar pill="">
                    <Tab label="Pill" />
                    <Tab label="B" />
                </TabBar>
                <TabBar flat="">
                    <Tab label="Flat" />
                    <Tab label="B" />
                </TabBar>
                <TabBar outline="">
                    <Tab label="Outline" />
                    <Tab label="B" />
                </TabBar>
                <TabBar segmented="">
                    <Tab label="Segmented" />
                    <Tab label="B" />
                </TabBar>
            </div>

            <div class="demo-section">
                <h3>{t("case.tab_bar.sizes")}</h3>
                <TabBar size="xsmall">
                    <Tab label="xsmall" />
                    <Tab label="B" />
                </TabBar>
                <TabBar size="small">
                    <Tab label="small" />
                    <Tab label="B" />
                </TabBar>
                <TabBar size="large">
                    <Tab label="large" />
                    <Tab label="B" />
                </TabBar>
            </div>

            <div class="demo-section">
                <h3>{t("case.tab_bar.with_icon")}</h3>
                <TabBar>
                    <Tab icon="User" label="Account" />
                    <Tab icon="Bell" label="Notifications" />
                    <Tab icon="Settings" label="Settings" />
                </TabBar>
            </div>

            <div class="demo-section">
                <h3>{t("case.tab_bar.disabled")}</h3>
                <TabBar>
                    <Tab label="Normal" />
                    <Tab label="Disabled" disabled="true" />
                    <Tab label="Selected" selected="true" />
                </TabBar>
            </div>

            <div class="demo-section">
                <h3>{t("case.tab_bar.menu")}</h3>
                <TabBar menu="true">
                    <Tab label="Tab 1" />
                    <Tab label="Tab 2" />
                    <Tab label="Tab 3" />
                    <Tab label="Tab 4" />
                    <Tab label="Tab 5" />
                    <Tab label="Tab 6" />
                </TabBar>
            </div>

            <div class="demo-section">
                <h3>{t("case.tab_bar.template")}</h3>
                <p>Tab 内放置 element 子节点作为标题内容（绕过 label 限制）：</p>
                <TabBar selected-index={active_tab} on-click={on_tab_select}>
                    <Tab>
                        <span>Account</span>
                        <Badge>3</Badge>
                    </Tab>
                    <Tab>
                        <span>Profile</span>
                    </Tab>
                </TabBar>
            </div>

            <div class="demo-section">
                <h3>{t("case.tab_bar.tab_item")}</h3>
                <p>TabItem 同时承载 title (header) 与 body (选中时渲染的内容)，对应 WPF TabControl/TabItem 模式：</p>
                <TabBar selected-index={active_tab} on-click={on_tab_select}>
                    <tab-item title="Account">
                        <div class="tab-body">
                            <p>Account settings panel</p>
                        </div>
                    </tab-item>
                    <tab-item title="Profile">
                        <div class="tab-body">
                            <p>User profile panel</p>
                        </div>
                    </tab-item>
                    <tab-item title="Settings">
                        <div class="tab-body">
                            <p>System settings panel</p>
                        </div>
                    </tab-item>
                </TabBar>
            </div>
        </Card>

        <Card title="示例代码">
            <p>点击下方 Tab 切换 <code>.rml</code> 声明文件与 <code>.rml.rs</code> 后端文件：</p>
            <TabBar selected-index={code_tab} on-click={on_code_tab_change}>
                <Tab label=".rml" />
                <Tab label=".rml.rs" />
            </TabBar>
            <div if={code_tab == 0}>
                <CodeEditor ref="rml_editor" value={rml_sample} language="rust" />
            </div>
            <div if={code_tab == 1}>
                <CodeEditor ref="rust_editor" value={rust_sample} language="rust" />
            </div>
        </Card>

        <Card title="API">
            <h3>TabBar</h3>
            <Table columns={tab_bar_api_columns} rows={tab_bar_api_rows} bordered="" stripe="" />
            <h3>Tab</h3>
            <Table columns={tab_api_columns} rows={tab_api_rows} bordered="" stripe="" />
        </Card>
    </div>
</component>
